OL,4,BTennis the saviour for player who      
OL,5,Btried to take own life before Wimbledon
OL,6,GThe clues were there. Leandro Riedi    
OL,7,Gstruggled to even force a smile after  
OL,8,Gwinning a match which moved him closer 
OL,9,Gto the Wimbledon main draw.            
OL,11,FThese are the moments usually          
OL,12,Fcherished and celebrated by a player   
OL,13,Franked outside of the world's top 100. 
OL,15,FThe Swiss player's solemn reaction was 
OL,16,Fjarring, but then nobody outside of    
OL,17,Fhis immediate circle knew what had     
OL,18,Fhappened a few days earlier.           
OL,20,FShortly before Wimbledon qualifying    
OL,21,Fbegan in June 2024, Riedi had tried to 
OL,22,Ftake his own life.                     
